  "content": "\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">目前，需要安裝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fhome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiFine</a>（或是像 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/fabulously-optimized\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Fabulously Optimized Modback</a> 這樣的替代方案），才能完整體驗 Barely Default 的所有功能*</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f15c74aaa6772fdcf0482c6bab7d9614b203940b_0.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"861\" height=\"294\"></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>讓我的世界充滿更多 Minecraft 元素</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">小時候，每次 Minecraft 更新都像過聖誕節一樣令人興奮！但有時更新的速度似乎有點慢……</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">《故事模式》與《地牢》推出時，我深深著迷於其中的新背景故事！然而這些內容從未真正加入遊戲中……</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pqqLxtn983g?list=PLO6GPyTLxi6tpgNiGLoKuTFc-dggL3w-O&index=1\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">與其等待官方更新，我決定親自填補這段空白。Barely Default 在維持原版美術風格的同時，串聯起整個 Minecraft 的官方設定。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">現代化視覺：我已更新了「遺落」的貼圖，以符合 Mojang 目前更為細緻的美術風格。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">最終呈現出一個既耳目一新、內容豐富，卻又令人感到熟悉的世界。我希望這份套件能讓你玩上好幾年，並且隨時都能發現新的細節！</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">依名稱區分的變體！</h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1kSjHyrZ60fVfBGip9Ho6QbFmMZ1CCtDfqIQLVj4hFvM/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊此連結查看 Barely Default 中所有名稱對應變體的完整清單</a></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.redd.it/s0q08ghzmtde1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"5863\" height=\"5942\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">也歡迎查看由 CYKLOPPS 和我共同開發的官方&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fbarely-default-data-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Barely Default 資料包</a></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h4>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">更多精彩功能！</h1>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/i9FjExcZ57Y?list=PLO6GPyTLxi6tpgNiGLoKuTFc-dggL3w-O&index=1\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/WQ73j2drgjE?list=PLO6GPyTLxi6tpgNiGLoKuTFc-dggL3w-O&index=1\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Th6UydWl_pM?list=PLO6GPyTLxi6tpgNiGLoKuTFc-dggL3w-O&index=1\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wtDQX262DZo?list=PLO6GPyTLxi6tpgNiGLoKuTFc-dggL3w-O&index=1\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/d4SU-ZELQAE?list=PLO6GPyTLxi6tpgNiGLoKuTFc-dggL3w-O&index=8&t=1\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/OI9APvuQJK4?list=PLO6GPyTLxi6tpgNiGLoKuTFc-dggL3w-O&index=1\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/IUatvyvlSZU?list=PLO6GPyTLxi6tpgNiGLoKuTFc-dggL3w-O&index=1\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
